written), putting things in a chest does not change the total weight.
(by the way, there's a YAFM if you try to put a chest/bag in itself which  
is not unrelated to the famous Klein bottle one)

OK, since I have a wiztest opened...

max capacity is 1000.
This correspond to 100 000$ unburdened. (actually probably 100 049$)
149 900$ burdened. (149 949. And so on)
199 900$ stressed.
249 900$ strained.
299 900$ overtaxed.


Funilly, the game let me wish for far more after being overloaded. (even  
if I cannot lift any more).
So I guess one can overflow the counter by wishing... but not by picking  
up gold, 300 000 is certainly pretty far from the overflow value (which is  
probably... err... 2^31 or something like that ?)

When lifting from a massive (>1 000 000) stack of gold, tha game only let  
me take 299 949$.

And even putting all this in a BoH or a super BoH (Slash'em Walelt of  
Perseus), I cannot reach 2 000 000.
Well, that's closer to the threshold but still not much...

However, it is possible to have a nice big stack of gold.
